              "# China announces $60 billion of U.S. goods for tariff retaliation\nPolitics Aug 3, 2018 10:08 AM EST\n\nBEIJING — China announced a $60 billion list of U.S. goods on Friday including coffee, honey and industrial chemicals for retaliation if Washington goes ahead with its latest tariff threat.\n\nThe Finance Ministry accused the Trump administration of damaging the global economy after it proposed hiking duties on $200 billion of Chinese goods in the second round of a dispute over technology",
